MITRE D3FEND
------------

src/d3fend/schema/, src/d3fend/datamodel/ and project/ model MITRE D3FEND,
edition 1.6.0 of 2026-08-31, which The MITRE Corporation publishes at
https://d3fend.mitre.org/. They are this project's rendering, not D3FEND's or
MITRE's. D3FEND and the D3FEND logo are trademarks of The MITRE Corporation.

upstream/d3fend.ttl is the ontology as MITRE publishes it, identical to its
counterpart at d3fend.mitre.org when it was read, and
scripts/check_upstream_release.py pins it by its git object hash.
src/d3fend/data/d3fend-1.6.0.yaml holds the same terms and text as records, but
for the abstracts named below, and src/d3fend/schema/d3fend_entries.yaml holds each property's label and definition
as a slot's title and description, each word for word, and so does what is
generated from it: project/, src/d3fend/datamodel/, docs/schema/, .lokf/d3fend.yaml
and the schema asset of a release. The schema's header carries the designation and
the licence into those files that keep it. tests/data/ holds short excerpts of
records under the same terms. upstream/TERMS.txt holds the Terms of
Use, https://d3fend.mitre.org/tou/, which authorise such copies on condition that
